<h1>Arewa Najm Ekua</h1>
<p>15th Police District Council, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Filed nominating petitions for reelection; on the Chicago Board of Elections candidate list as of Oct. 30, 2026. No campaign website or platform found.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Chair of the 15th District Council, also known as Karen &quot;Arewa&quot; Winters; placed first in the district in 2023. Case manager at Bobby E. Wright Comprehensive Community Health Care Center, organizer with Austin Coming Together, and founder of The 411 Movement for Pierre Loury.</p>
